title: The Government's Offer
subtitle: An urgent card: the government makes an offer to the strikers, or the police act against them.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_union_rules && PolishUnions.offerCardActive(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// The answer of PPS to an offer of the government or to the repression of a strike (Z — 0.87, decision 5A of 24 X 2026; until
// 0.86 the event The Strike and the Sejm): accept, strike on or end without a settlement; it costs no month. An accepted
// settlement always ends the strike (6B).
PolishUnions.offerCardView(Q);
!}

= The government's offer

[+ pl_off_text +]

- @accept
- @continue
- @end

@accept
title: Accept the offer
subtitle: The strike ends on the agreed terms; the settlement is due next month. The workers' wages rise for two months.
view-if: pl_off_has_offer = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_union_result = PolishUnions.offerCardChoose(Q, 'accept');
!}
go-to: result

@continue
title: Strike on
subtitle: [+ pl_off_continue_line +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_union_result = PolishUnions.offerCardChoose(Q, 'continue');
!}
go-to: result

@end
title: End the strike without a settlement
subtitle: The unions feel let down: their dissent rises (+10) and their trust falls (−8).
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_union_result = PolishUnions.offerCardChoose(Q, 'end');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= The government's offer

[+ pl_union_result +]

- @root: Continue.
